  bx_fox: {"tier": 0, "zh": "九尾狐", "en": "Nine-Tailed Fox", "bio": {"zh": "修行千年的金毛狐狸，身後九條尾巴像扇子一樣展開，尾尖燃著藍色狐火。眼睛細長帶紅，會讓迷路的旅人一直在原地打轉。", "en": "A golden fox with a thousand years of cultivation, nine tails fanned out behind it, blue fox-fire burning at their tips. Its long red eyes can keep a lost traveller walking in circles all night."}, "habitat": {"zh": "月夜的竹林與古墳", "en": "Bamboo groves and old graves on moonlit nights"}},
